  "correction": "Initial runtime, public inherent const method and const trait hypotheses omitted independently required regular/const stability annotations. Added those original policies without changing required outcomes; failed inputs/diagnostics retained. The no_core unit constructor separately requires Copy. Paired inherent-method controls now use an empty enum with no synthesized constructor, preserving the method/allowance question; the old unit source is retained. The enum also requires the no_core Copy language interface; method controls now retain the real Clone/Copy/receiver declarations and u8 implementations rather than relying on the isolated type constructor hypothesis. Added required staged regular stability to the real receiver/Clone/Copy implementations; initial missing-policy diagnostic retained."
